    writingguide_sweep_eval_test.go:99:   [1] axis=conflation severity=substantive repair=split
              quote: The truth is the opposite: 36 of the store's 58 sessions have a completed shell and 17 more an abandoned one — Christopher concludes nearly every dialogue — but the engine recorded each conclude only as the shell's own event, while the metadata-level record the collector reads was never written, its write site lost in the mid-July session-model rebuild. The store was not full of unended dialogues; it was full of endings the engine had failed to record.
              reasoning: This passage doesn't narrate the act of shipping commit a08266b4 — it re-derives and states a corrected understanding of the store's actual historical state (36/58 sessions concluded, 17 abandoned, the missing write site) as a synthesized claim about how the world is, which is exactly what an insight entry captures ('what have we synthesized?'). A future reader who wants just the corrected conclude-rate diagnosis, independent of whether slice 4 shipped, would need to pull this specific claim on its own, so it is a second coherent thing riding inside the done rather than a mention pointing back at it.
    writingguide_sweep_eval_test.go:99:   [2] axis=dilution severity=minor repair=cut
              quote: the collection pass removed exactly one session before the derivation fix and fifty at a 24-hour retention after it, leaving only the genuinely open and the recently ended; an independent run at the default fourteen days removed forty-three and was idempotent
              reasoning: These tallies are measurements left over from a checking run rather than the claim itself: the actionable meaning for a future reader is that the derivation fix now retains only genuinely open or recently-ended sessions and that collection is idempotent at default retention. The exact counts (one, fifty, forty-three) are snapshot-specific figures against a store that keeps changing, and per the done kind's own guidance such leftover counts just bind later readers to reconcile numbers that add nothing to the verified claim.
